OL,4,CMissed chances to save boy, 2,         
OL,5,Cmurdered by grandparents despite dad's 
OL,6,Cconcerns                               
OL,7,GOpportunities to protect a two-year-   
OL,8,Gold who was murdered by his            
OL,9,Ggrandparents were missed by multiple   
OL,10,Gagencies, a review has found.          
OL,12,FEthan Ives-Griffiths died on 16 August 
OL,13,F2021 after suffering a "catastrophic"  
OL,14,Fhead injury at his grandparents' home  
OL,15,Fin Garden City, Flintshire. He had     
OL,16,Fbeen beaten, starved and deprived of   
OL,17,Ffluids.                                
OL,19,FNorth Wales Safeguarding Board         
OL,20,Fapologised "unreservedly" after a      
OL,21,Freview found attempts by his dad to    
OL,22,Fraise concerns were not acted uponG1/4 
