OL,4,C'I use a bowl to wash myself and I'm   
OL,5,C#400 in debt - energy price rise       
OL,6,Cscares me'                             
OL,7,GA woman who no longer cooks hot meals, 
OL,8,Gand washes herself using a bowl to     
OL,9,Gsave money, says the thought of a big  
OL,10,Grise in the cost of energy from        
OL,11,GJanuary has sent her anxiety "through  
OL,12,Gthe roof".                             
OL,14,FHolly, who is 49 and has serious       
OL,15,Fhealth conditions, said she already    
OL,16,Fowes her electricity provider #400,    
OL,17,Fand has been wearing layers to cut     
OL,18,Fback on heating at home.               
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
