OL,4,CJilted bride who went ahead with her   
OL,5,Cwedding alone finally walks down the   
OL,6,Caisle                                  
OL,7,GA bride who became a social media      
OL,8,Gsensation after being jilted at the    
OL,9,Galtar has described the "pure magic"   
OL,10,Gof finally walking down the aisle.     
OL,12,FKayley Stead's fiance did not turn up  
OL,13,Ffor her big day in 2022, but she       
OL,14,Fsurprised everyone by letting the      
OL,15,Fcelebration continue with many         
OL,16,Fagreeing to "just go with this         
OL,17,Fmadness".                              
OL,19,FFour years on and she has found love   
OL,20,Fagain, reconnecting with an old        
OL,21,Funiversity friend who did turn up for  
OL,22,Ftheir ceremony on Friday 13th NoveG3/4 
